    "detailed_description": "Enter a world where filth is your greatest enemy! Extreme Cleaning Simulator is a realistic simulation game where you step into the shoes of a professional cleaner, specializing in the most extreme cases of utterly trashed homes. Your job is to restore order to spaces that have been through absolute hell \u2013 from hoarder-infested dwellings to squatter dens overrun by bugs and the homeless.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/b5e35fe8b9acc71cbe2e484534faea9c.poster.avif?t=1742381311\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/b5e35fe8b9acc71cbe2e484534faea9c.webm?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/b5e35fe8b9acc71cbe2e484534faea9c.mp4?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Put on your heavy-duty gloves, grab your mop, and prepare to face dried-up grime, mountains of trash, and stains of unknown origin. You'll have access to a range of professional cleaning tools \u2013 from basic detergents to high-powered equipment designed to battle dirt, mold, and infestations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/2bac2f2f149c972a1d73adeede4990de.poster.avif?t=1742381311\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/2bac2f2f149c972a1d73adeede4990de.webm?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/2bac2f2f149c972a1d73adeede4990de.mp4?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic cleaning mechanics \u2013 scrub off stubborn stains, wash windows, remove tons of garbage, and reclaim order from chaos.<br></li><li>The worst of the worst \u2013 tackle apartments that should probably be condemned, but instead, it\u2019s up to you to restore them.<br></li><li>Professional tools \u2013 mop, pressure washer, industrial vacuum, hardcore cleaning chemicals, and much more.<br></li><li>Challenging jobs \u2013 every location tells a different (and often horrifying) story.<br></li><li>A satirical touch \u2013 absurdly filthy interiors and cleaning scenarios straight out of a nightmare.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/62ce95ff5372e2234fd379698af09675.poster.avif?t=1742381311\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/62ce95ff5372e2234fd379698af09675.webm?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/62ce95ff5372e2234fd379698af09675.mp4?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Do you have the stomach (and the nerves) for this job? Extreme Cleaning Simulator will put you to the ultimate test!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/fd53e177cb54a471d2d5fe8410b7605b.poster.avif?t=1742381311\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/fd53e177cb54a471d2d5fe8410b7605b.webm?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/fd53e177cb54a471d2d5fe8410b7605b.mp4?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
