ures:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic cleaning mechanics \u2013 scrub off stubborn stains, wash windows, remove tons of garbage, and reclaim order from chaos.<br></li><li>The worst of the worst \u2013 tackle apartments that should probably be condemned, but instead, it\u2019s up to you to restore them.<br></li><li>Professional tools \u2013 mop, pressure washer, industrial vacuum, hardcore cleaning chemicals, and much more.<br></li><li>Challenging jobs \u2013 every location tells a different (and often horrifying) story.<br></li><li>A satirical touch \u2013 absurdly filthy interiors and cleaning scenarios straight out of a nightmare.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/62ce95ff5372e2234fd379698af09675.poster.avif?t=1742381311\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/62ce95ff5372e2234fd379698af09675.webm?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/62ce95ff5372e2234fd379698af09675.mp4?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Do you have the stomach (and the nerves) for this job? Extreme Cleaning Simulator will put you to the ultimate test!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/fd53e177cb54a471d2d5fe8410b7605b.poster.avif?t=1742381311\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/fd53e177cb54a471d2d5fe8410b7605b.webm?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586920/extras/fd53e177cb54a471d2d5fe8410b7605b.mp4?t=1742381311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
